Discovery — find real process-level memory metric keys
fetch metric.series
| filter contains(metric.key, "dt.process") and contains(metric.key, "mem")
| summarize count(), by:{metric.key}
| sort metric.key asc

🔍 Discovery — find page fault metric keys (process or host level)
fetch metric.series
| filter contains(metric.key, "fault")
| summarize count(), by:{metric.key}
| sort metric.key asc
